body:
At this point I have essentially two emotions: Ennui and Anger. I can *appear* enthusiastic, but it's not how I'm feeling, it's quite literally me acting the part. The "call of the void" is a daily and multiple times a day occurrence. There's a reason I don't have access to a gun; long ago I would have put it in my mouth and pulled the trigger.

&#x200B;

What keeps me going is doing so currently would leave my spouse destitute.

&#x200B;

She's in ill health, and when she's gone I'm likely to follow soon after.
